Subject: [PATCH] fix(console): preserve non-string first arguments

Port of https://github.com/boa-dev/boa/pull/5688.

Adapted to boa_wintertc 0.22: its console prints objects across lines, so the test expects that layout.
---
 src/console/mod.rs   | 16 ++++++++++++----
 src/console/tests.rs | 39 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 51 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

